{"reviews":[{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-0","r":5.0,"t":"I love this oil","x":"I love this oil.  I received it this morning and put it on immediately.  Its 3 hours later the fragrance is still on me.  Actually I was stopped and asked what I was wearing. The oil is oil and not water down oil.  I will order this again!!","h":39,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-1","r":1.0,"t":"So blown...","x":"So,  I read all the other reviews,  and thought this would be a good product..... its not. The oil is diluted. The scent is faint and does not last more then 5 min.  It's over priced,  especially for being so watery. I was excited for days waiting for it to get delivered,  and the disappointment I had when I got it was just so sad.  I don't recommend buying from this seller.  I AM HIGHLY DISAPPOINTED.","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2021"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-2","r":5.0,"t":"Smells very nice \u2764\ufe0f\u2764\ufe0f","x":"This is the SECOND time I purchase this amazing scent I personally feel like this oil smells better than the actual perfume.","h":14,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2020"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-3","r":1.0,"t":"Too small for my liking..disappointed","x":"I didnt expect it to be so friggin small..im so disappointed...it cost so much and yet its so small.. will never purchase again..","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-4","r":3.0,"t":"Only 1 oz! Check the description","x":"It smells really lovely. I just wish I read that I would only be receiving 1 oz of fragrance or I may have searched elsewhere. The photo is moderately deceiving on size. This great for a fragrance perfume. bad for body oil.","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2017"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-5","r":5.0,"t":"Great!!!","x":"I know this one has to be a big seller, adore this oil...it doesn't last all day, but it lingers for a while on the body. The consistency is good, to me not as oily which a great thing. Absorbs very quick with leaving the oily feel. On my list for re-order!!!","h":8,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-6","r":4.0,"t":"Pink Friday perfume oil by Bargz","x":"Just got it today after ordering it since the 8 of this month saying that it would arrive by the 17 not happy about that also don't like the misleading fact of how you expect the bottle to look like, what you see and it's in an entirely different bottle...I do have to say it smells great can't wait to use it though. May or may not order again from them again depends on my order arrival issues.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2015"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-7","r":5.0,"t":"Pink Friday","x":"Shipping was faster than expected. Packaging was good. The smell is amazing, long lasting. I will use this to put into my body butter I make and sell I know this will be a number one. The smell is sweet and noticeable I love it . I got a nice amount for the money so definitely recommend.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-8","r":5.0,"t":"Everlasting scent.","x":"Wow this smells so good and I recommend this plus it last and this is what you want for the scent to last long and it does that.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-9","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I used it to make soap.  Didn't get a single complaint.","h":6,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-10","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent Smell","x":"I was really surprised with the smell of Pink. It was recommended to try it, and to my surprise I really love the scent. I'm glad I gave it a try. If you are considering buying Pink, you will not be disappointed.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-11","r":5.0,"t":"Order arrived promptly.","x":"I like my purchase, I don't know what the original fragrance smell like, however I like this one and would purchase again, its long lasting and you only need a small amount.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2020"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-12","r":5.0,"t":".  I LOVE IT! \ud83d\ude32","x":"I love the scent. Take a sniff at this \ud83d\ude32 omg smells and feels great.  Can't wait to mess with more. I ran into this oil by surfing and reading the reviews.  I LOVE IT!","h":4,"v":0,"d":"Aug 2021"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-13","r":5.0,"t":"AMAZING SCENT, LASTS...LOVE THIS!","x":"This arrived today in the mail and I absolutely love it.  Smells so dang good ... \ud83d\ude02  overall its amazing  and I would recommend it.  \ud83d\udc8b","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2020"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great Product and prompt shipping!","x":"I absolutely LOVE this product! I bought it for my diffuser n it gave the house a sweet yet soft scent. The bottle came very well packaged,  thank the good Lord, there was a seal under the cap because the top was broken,  through shipping,  I  suppose.  I highly recommend this product as well as the seller. I will DEFINITELY be ordering AGAIN. Thank you to the seller for a PHENOMENAL product!","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-15","r":5.0,"t":"The best thing I used","x":"If u haven\u2019t try this product I don\u2019t what u waiting for the scent is sooooooooo amazing this is my 3 rd time ordering this n I will keep ordering it I get complements alllll day I love it I will never stop using it u just don\u2019t get tired of the smell if u want something that\u2019s stay on u allll day go order this u will not be disappointed I love it keep up the good work sis \ud83e\udd70\ud83d\udc95","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2021"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-16","r":3.0,"t":"Has an acceptable scent, however I expected it to ...","x":"Has an acceptable scent, however I expected it to last a bit longer that is disappointing....dont think I will do a repurchase.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-17","r":5.0,"t":"Good scent!","x":"I bought the 1 oz bottle to see if I liked it...it smells really good and others like it also. I will be getting a bigger bottle b4 I run out! O yeah i can't compair it to nicki Minaj's actually perfume because I haven't had it but if u like sweet floral kinda fruity feminine scents u would like this. A girl at worked said I smell like candy lol.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2021"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-18","r":1.0,"t":"I NEED A REFUND !!!","x":"I am not happy with this at ALL I was really excited about getting this because of the good reviews but NOOO this is not it ,I applied this on my hands and it started to BURNNN and I went to my restroom and this is what I saw I am very DISAPPOINTED !!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2020"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-19","r":5.0,"t":"Chloe Yazmean","x":"I watched a YouTuber (name in headline), and she recommended these and I fell in love I love applying these when I get out of the shower, and with lotion smell wonderful.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2020"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-20","r":5.0,"t":"She likes it!","x":"My lady loves it! She said it\u2019s long lasting and pairs well with the actual perfume. She does make her own lotions/body butters, so the scent last all day.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-21","r":1.0,"t":"not quite!!!","x":"Nick Minaj? yeah, after her showering three days while on vacay in bermuda! smells like straight coconut oil.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-22","r":4.0,"t":"Try Me !!!","x":"The fresh scent not loud on the body just why he\u2019s it lasted longer on the body !!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2023"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-23","r":5.0,"t":"Smells so good!","x":"I gave this perfume as a gift and she loves it.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2016"},{"id":"B00XYM8CH4-24","r":3.0,"t":"It smells really nice. It does not last very long and it ...","x":"It smells really nice. It does not last very long and it looks watered down. Usually when I buy this from my stores in the neighborhood I can't see clear through it like this one and they last a long time. I guess for the money it might be good but I don't see myself ordering again.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the scent as pleasant, amazing, or better than expected.","cites":[1,3,8,9,11,13,14]},{"text":"Many say the fragrance is long lasting or lingers for a while.","cites":[1,6,8,9,12,14]},{"text":"Several reviewers complain the bottle is small for the price and the size is misleading.","cites":[4,5,7]},{"text":"A few reviewers say the oil is diluted or watery and the scent fades quickly.","cites":[2,6]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention fast or prompt shipping and good packaging.","cites":[8,12,15]}]},"qa":[]}